    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In the bustling world of reportorial journalism, Josphat Kioko stands out as a seasoned Kenyan media professional with a unique and inspiring journey. His love for the spoken word began early, in the innocent days of primary school when he would record himself on cassette tapes, eager to share his messages with the world.",
